# Permissões do Gateway Central
user coldchain-app
topic read coldchain/+/telemetry
topic read coldchain/+/status
topic write coldchain/+/cmd
topic write coldchain/+/ack

# Permissões Dinâmicas por Dispositivo (%u = username do ESP32)
pattern write coldchain/%u/telemetry
pattern write coldchain/%u/status
pattern read coldchain/%u/cmd
pattern read coldchain/%u/ack
